01:41:12.960 --> 01:41:18.800
from every aspect that you can think of from&nbsp;
financial to social media to e-commerce,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:41:18.800 --> 01:41:24.560
people interacting with the internet should&nbsp;
be identified by a domain name because it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:41:24.560 --> 01:41:28.320
a really powerful way to identify somebody.
Tim Ferriss: So here's the question. Do you&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:41:28.320 --> 01:41:29.800
