Andrew Rosener: What do you mean?&nbsp;

01:41:36.107 --> 01:41:39.240
Tim Ferriss: Well, do you think it'll be — I mean,&nbsp;
a lot of people have .eth, a lot of people have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:41:39.240 --> 01:41:45.360
then you of course have .coms, but those&nbsp;
