standard. I mentioned before, the ICANN governs&nbsp;
the, let's say the legacy DNS, the root zone.&nbsp;

01:45:04.120 --> 01:45:11.600
If you have, I don't know, an unstoppable domain,&nbsp;
you've got timferriss.x, okay, they have the .x,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:11.600 --> 01:45:18.880
they've got .wallet, they've got whatever. So&nbsp;
let's say you've got tim.wallet. Okay, easy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:45:18.880 --> 01:45:24.680
tim.wallet. And you tell me, "Hey, send me one&nbsp;
ETH." I can send you one ETH to tim.wallet because&nbsp;&nbsp;

