Tim Ferriss: Yeah, that's asking a lot of people.&nbsp;

01:46:35.080 --> 01:46:37.360
Andrew Rosener: Way too much. That's never&nbsp;
going to happen. And so for that reason,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:37.360 --> 01:46:41.800
it's never going to resolve. The second thing is&nbsp;
that with decentralization, I think decentralized&nbsp;&nbsp;

