striking good looks, not just our resemblances&nbsp;
to Jason Statham, but also I think you wrestled.&nbsp;

01:57:35.160 --> 01:57:36.080
Andrew Rosener: Yes.
Tim Ferriss: I know&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:57:36.080 --> 01:57:40.904
your wrestling coach and your experience&nbsp;
wrestling had a huge formative impact on you.&nbsp;

01:57:40.904 --> 01:57:43.960
Andrew Rosener: Huge.
Tim Ferriss: And I'm not sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

