01:57:48.904 --> 01:57:51.120
Andrew Rosener: Chicken and the egg problem.
Tim Ferriss: Yeah, chicken and the egg problem.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:57:52.200 --> 01:57:55.440
And there are other ways, of course, that&nbsp;
people develop high pain tolerances. I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:57:55.440 --> 01:57:58.880
you could have childhood trauma and learn&nbsp;
to dissociate. I mean, I actually a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

